<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#racism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept of racism, defined as prejudice, discrimination, or antagonism directed against someone of a different race based on the belief that racial groups possess distinct characteristics, abilities, or qualities that make some races inherently superior or inferior to others. This concept is central to understanding the meme's text and the historical figure depicted."@en .
