<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#Nazi_Party> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The National Socialist German Workers' Party (NSDAP), a far-right political party in Germany that came to power in 1933 under Adolf Hitler. The party was responsible for the Holocaust and the systematic persecution and murder of millions of people, primarily Jews, Roma, disabled individuals, and others deemed undesirable. The party's ideology was built on extreme racism and anti-Semitism."@en .
