<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dramaticallyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates one dimension revealing information another dimension does not provide in memes, e.g. text revealing information visuals don't show"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#assertion_about_01247> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme uses a historical figure associated with genocide and extreme racism to make a joke about racism, which can trivialize the suffering of victims and normalize harmful ideologies."@en .
