<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#genocide> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The deliberate and systematic destruction, in whole or in part, of an ethnic, racial, religious, or national group. The Holocaust is the most infamous example of genocide, and the term is essential for understanding the historical context of the figure in the image."@en .
