<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Toxicity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Toxicity Assessment includes: harmful elements, offensive content, toxic indicators, problematic elements, negative aspects, and harmful signals."@en .
