<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target audience for this meme is individuals familiar with the historical context of Adolf Hitler and the Nazi regime, particularly those who understand the concept of racism and the Holocaust. The meme relies on the viewer's knowledge of Hitler as the epitome of racist ideology to create irony and satire. Therefore, the intended audience includes people who are aware of 20th-century European history, specifically the rise of Nazism and its genocidal policies. The meme is designed to provoke thought or humor through the juxtaposition of a symbol of extreme racism with a logically absurd statement, which requires a baseline understanding of the historical figure and the concept of race-based prejudice. The audience is likely to be adults with access to historical education or media, as the content is not suitable for children or those unfamiliar with the Holocaust and Nazi atrocities."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dramaticallyIronicalTo> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#relationIndex> "14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
