<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#contempt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Adolf Hitler's stern, unsmiling gaze and rigid facial posture convey a sense of disdain or contempt, consistent with his historical persona as a figure of authoritarianism and hatred. His direct stare and set jaw suggest a dismissive or superior attitude."@en .
