<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Modal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One dimension showing certainty versus another dimension showing ambiguity in memes, e.g. text certainty vs. visual ambiguity"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TemplateStructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Dimension> .
