<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#anti_semitism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of racism and prejudice directed against Jewish people. It was a core component of Nazi ideology and led to the Holocaust. The meme's text implicitly references this by using the concept of 'race' to frame the discussion, which is a key element of anti-Semitic propaganda."@en .
