<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01247#irony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A rhetorical device in which the intended meaning is the opposite of the literal meaning. The meme uses irony to highlight the absurdity of the statement 'you can't be racist if there is no other race' by pairing it with Hitler, who is the epitome of racist ideology. The irony is only understood by recognizing the historical context."@en .
